  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340154f7d5496ac4a5fe0c/step-6f534f00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place wedges on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the wedges between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340154f7d5496ac4a5fe0c/step-ccf3ec10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the wedges are baking, slice cucumber into thin rounds.\n• In a medium bowl, combine the white wine vinegar (for the pickle) and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Add cucumber to the pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover cucumber. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340154f7d5496ac4a5fe0c/step-1726e720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. Sprinkle over All-American spice blend, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340154f7d5496ac4a5fe0c/step-6ae30f30.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While chicken is cooking, halve bake-at-home burger buns and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 minutes.\n• In a third medium bowl, combine shredded cabbage mix and mustard mayo. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340154f7d5496ac4a5fe0c/step-b1d14d40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the tray with wedges, sprinkle over chicken salt and toss to coat.\n• Drain pickled cucumber.\n• Top burger buns with mustard mayo slaw, DIY Southern plant-based fried chicken and some pickled cucumber.\n• Serve with sweet potato wedges and remaining cucumber. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68340154f7d5496ac4a5fe0c/step-2a555350.jpg"
    }
  ]
